{"schema":1,"id":"motivate","title":"Motivate","composer":"Claude","concept":"a building montage that never cuts away.","about":["Motivate is the soundtrack of a montage: a bass that walks with intent, a piano engine turning over the changes, strings that swell through a four-bar riser, and a theme \u2014 stated by horns, answered by celli \u2014 that climbs more than it settles. Every sixteen bars the harmony leans stepwise back into home, so the loop is a resolution, never a cut.","Unlike the Focus rooms, every layer here plays the same form: variants are alternate performances of it, sections return only on its downbeat, and a quiet conductor decides which parts of the arrangement are on. The montage keeps building; it never arrives, and it never stops."],"accent":"#c9a34e","key":"E aeolian","bpm":104,"layers":[{"id":"ground","name":"ground","role":"bed","always":true,"gain":0.6,"gainRange":[0.48,0.72],"minOn":60,"minOff":0,"quantizeBars":16,"variants":[{"file":"audio/ground-a.m4a","loopSeconds":36.923,"notes":[[0.0,0.822,40,58],[0.865,0.274,40,58],[1.154,0.548,35,58],[1.731,0.548,40,58],[2.308,0.822,36,58],[3.173,0.274,36,58],[3.462,0.548,31,58],[4.038,0.548,36,58],[4.615,0.822,31,58],[5.481,0.274,31,58],[5.769,0.548,38,58],[6.346,0.548,31,58],[6.923,0.822,38,58],[7.788,0.274,38,58],[8.077,0.548,33,58],[8.654,0.548,38,58],[9.231,0.822,40,58],[10.096,0.274,40,58],[10.385,0.548,35,58],[10.962,0.548,40,58],[11.538,0.822,36,58],[12.404,0.274,36,58],[12.692,0.548,31,58],[13.269,0.548,36,58],[13.846,0.822,31,58],[14.712,0.274,31,58],[15.0,0.548,38,58],[15.577,0.548,35,58],[16.154,0.822,38,58],[17.019,0.274,38,58],[17.308,0.548,33,58],[17.885,0.548,38,58],[18.462,0.822,33,58],[19.327,0.274,33,58],[19.615,0.548,40,58],[20.192,0.548,33,58],[20.769,0.822,35,58],[21.635,0.274,35,58],[21.923,0.548,42,58],[22.5,0.548,35,58],[23.077,0.822,36,58],[23.942,0.274,36,58],[24.231,0.548,43,58],[24.808,0.548,36,58],[25.385,0.548,38,58],[25.962,0.548,38,58],[26.538,0.548,36,58],[27.11